492 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (This expression matrix captures far more than ageing-related variation. Gene expression in cfRNA reflects a complex mixture of biological and technical signals. Biological variation includes factors such as sex, physiological state, recent illness, medication use, and lifestyle, many of which are not systematically recorded in our dataset. For healthy donors, age and sex are the main available demographic variables. In contrast, technical sources of variation are generally better documented. Consequently, the ageing signal, which is weak and distributed across many genes, can be difficult to distinguish from these other sources of variability.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
