/Title (Weighted Gene Co-expression Network Analysis looks at genes as a network. Each gene is a node, and edges are correlation, reflecting the co-expression. This gave 11 modules of 116 to 1,257 genes, while 71% of genes stayed unassigned.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1704 0 R
/Prev 1784 0 R
